@startuml 5b-state-submission
!include _style.iuml
title EduFlow — State Machine: Submission (one per student per assignment)

state "Not submitted" as NotSubmitted : no row yet
state Missing : deadline passed,\nstill no submission
state Submitted
state UnderReview as "Under review" : student can no longer\nreplace files
state Graded : marks + feedback\n(released or hidden)
state Returned as "Returned for revision"
state Resubmitted

[*] --> NotSubmitted : assignment published
NotSubmitted --> Missing : [now > due_at]
NotSubmitted --> Submitted : submit\n/ attempt = 1, is_late = false
Missing --> Submitted : submit [late allowed]\n/ is_late = true

Submitted --> Submitted : replace files\n[before review]
Submitted --> UnderReview : teacher: review
Submitted --> Graded : teacher: grade
Submitted --> Returned : teacher: return\n[feedback given]

UnderReview --> Graded : teacher: grade
UnderReview --> Returned : teacher: return

Graded --> Graded : regrade / release grade\n/ notify when released
Graded --> Returned : teacher: return\n(e.g. after student's\nresubmission request)

Returned --> Resubmitted : student: resubmit\n/ attempt + 1
Resubmitted --> Resubmitted : replace files\n[before review]
Resubmitted --> UnderReview : teacher: review
Resubmitted --> Graded : teacher: grade
Resubmitted --> Returned : teacher: return

Graded --> [*] : assignment closed

note right of Graded
  Every transition is written to
  grading_history. Invalid transitions
  are rejected with HTTP 409.
end note
@enduml
